From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 04:17:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Vibrator: give apps a rounded calibration of the motor, for
 every app uid, with a valid frequency profile

Squash of former patches:

- 0004 Vibrator: give apps a rounded calibration of the motor
- 0008 Vibrator: round the calibration for every app uid, not only ids 10000 to 19999
- 0009 Vibrator: keep a valid frequency profile in the rounded calibration
---
 core/java/android/os/VibratorCoarse.java      | 46 +++++++++++++++++++
 core/java/android/os/VibratorInfo.java        | 40 ++++++++++++++++
 .../vibrator/VibratorManagerService.java      | 16 +++++++
 3 files changed, 102 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 core/java/android/os/VibratorCoarse.java

